{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24421","headline":"春日题乾元寺上方最高峰亭 · 白居易","name":"春日题乾元寺上方最高峰亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危亭绝顶四无邻，见尽三千世界春。\n但觉虚空无障碍，不知高下几由旬。\n回看官路三条线，却望都城一片尘。\n宾客暂游无半日，王侯不到便终身。\n始知天造空闲境，不爲忙人富贵人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}